{"supplier":"hotelbeds","supplierHotelId":"1030332","name":"Riad Dar Mamouni","description":"Riad Dar Mamouni is a tranquil oasis nestled in the heart of Marrakech's medina. This traditional riad, seamlessly integrated into the city's historic environment, offers an authentic and immersive experience. Located near the famous Jemaa el-Fna square, the Bahia Palace, and the bustling souks, it provides easy access to Marrakech's main attractions. Architecture and Decor Built in traditional Moroccan style, Riad Dar Mamouni features a central courtyard around which the various rooms are arranged. The courtyard is often adorned with lush plants, a murmuring fountain, and colorful zellige tiles. The tastefully decorated rooms blend modern comfort with traditional elements such as handcrafted lanterns, Berber rugs, and intricately carved wooden furniture. Accommodation The riad offers several rooms and suites, each uniquely decorated and arranged. The rooms are equipped with all modern","address":"El Geza Derbe Lamsauber 57 Rue Bab Doukkala, 56","city":"Marrakech","countryCode":"MA","postalCode":"40000","lat":31.6331447,"lng":-7.9978121,"stars":3,"giataCode":"738932","phone":"+212662839857","email":"riadarmamouni@gmail.com","website":"https://riaddarmamouni.com/","images":[{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/10/1030332/1030332a_hb_a_001.jpg?20240930191029?20250811115131","category":"exterior","order":0},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/10/1030332/1030332a_hb_a_002_20250811_095146.jpg?20250811115146","category":"exterior","order":1},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/10/1030332/1030332a_hb_a_003_20250811_095157.jpg?20250811115157","category":"exterior","order":2},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/10/1030332/1030332a_hb_l_001.jpg?20240930191036?20250811115131","category":"lobby","order":3},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/10/1030332/1030332a_hb_l_002_20250811_095220.jpg?20250811115220","category":"l